# Image context for the @callback/web SPA.
#
# The Dockerfile copies the manifests + sources it needs explicitly, so
# the safest pattern is to ignore everything not on its allowlist.
# Anything not matched below will still be on the build host's tar
# stream and consumed by the build stage, but the explicit COPYs are
# the source of truth for what ends up in the final image.

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

node_modules
**/node_modules

dist
**/dist
build
**/build
coverage
**/coverage
.tmp
.temp

*.log

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Project-specific noise that never belongs in a build context.
.vscode
.idea
docs
deploy
infra
README.md
